Show the JavaScript JIT site setting in the page info bubble, so JIT can be
turned off per site without enterprise policy. Sites with JIT off run jitless:
then the seccomp W^X restriction (0178/0183) applies to their renderers, and
WebAssembly runs in V8's interpreter (0212 + DrumBrake). Vanadium has similar UI
on Android (its 0216/0260).

